Answer from SOURCE only, knowledge basis 2023-11-29. No later knowledge, guesses or voting advice. Return ONLY one JSON object, with EXACTLY these fields: outcome (SUPPORTED, INSUFFICIENT_EVIDENCE or SOURCE_CONFLICT), span_ids (nonempty list of copied IDs supporting your answer), actor (GOVERNMENT or COMMITTEE: who ACTUALLY makes the taxes-or-spending-cuts forecast?). Do not add claims, explanations, quotes, money calculations for an employee, or any other field. outcome evaluates the QUESTION: an unknown burden is INSUFFICIENT_EVIDENCE; a false speaker premise is SOURCE_CONFLICT. Still extract the cited financing-specified flag or actual speaker to explain a refused question. False financing_specified means the initiative leaves financing open, not that the answer is missing. Choose the actual source actor, not one incorrectly suggested by the question.
